{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command 'Get-Content .rsi/TASK.json -Raw'","aggregated_output":"{\n  \"taskId\": \"tf-0297-a05\",\n  \"sourceTaskId\": \"TF-0297\",\n  \"title\": \"Re-verify A5 adaptive-context-budget controlled pilot gate\",\n  \"baseCommit\": \"fd04f0b4d1b4174bb303d91c43df04289e286b6f\",\n  \"objective\": \"A05 按原 spec 门限复验 A5 Adaptive Context Budget 受控 pilot 门；逐条映射可执行证据，不重定义门限；恢复 `area-composition-spec.md` 指定的 `ContextBudgetPlanner`（含 `replanOnResume`）组合 facade，补齐 resume re-plan 与 P5 现有测试、coverage 守卫。\",\n  \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n    \"判据1 plan adoption rate ≥80%（即 ignored ≤20%）+ `degrade_to_default_budget`：deprecation-counters 与 compaction-budget-shadow 当前断言 PASS。\",\n    \"判据2 planner p99 ≤30ms：compression-planner 与 performance-budgets 当前断言 PASS。\",\n    \"判据3 `ContextBudgetPlanner.replanOnResume` resume 后重跑：`openclaw_runtime/src/agents/cross-area/cross-area-facades.ts` 实现 + `tests/unit/cross-area-composition.test.ts`（3.6）+ `tests/unit/deep/a5-deep.test.ts`，PASS。\",\n    \"判据4 started wave 不可 re-plan：resource-aware-wave-scheduler 单测 PASS。\",\n    \"判据5 ignored >20% → `degrade_to_default_budget`：现有 registry 单测 PASS。\",\n    \"判据6 A1+A5+A3 cumulative per-turn smoke p99 ≤300ms：performance-budgets 断言 PASS。\",\n    \"P5 threshold clamp/default ladder、budgetShadow diagnostics-only、nativeMemory/nativeContextGating provenance、真实 compaction counter 调用点均由现有测试覆盖，PASS。\",\n    \"移除树中不存在的 `tests/unit/cross-area-composition.test.ts` 与 `cross-area/cross-area-facades.ts` 引用；requiredTests 与 coverage 守卫同步。\",\n    \"干净候选定向测试、类型、scoped lint、harness validate/dry-run、comms replay/compare 通过，凭据扫描 0 命中，SHA256SUMS 可回读。\"\n  ],\n  \"targetScope\": [\n    \"harness/specs/tasks/a5-adaptive-context-budget-pilot.md\",\n    \"tests/unit/a05-a5-gate-coverage.test.ts\",\n    \"tests/unit/cross-area-composition.test.ts\",\n    \"tests/unit/deep/a5-deep.test.ts\",\n    \"harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-a05-adaptive-context-budget-pilot-reverify.md\",\n    \"docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a05-adaptive-context-budget-gate.md\",\n    \"docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a05-acceptance.json\",\n    \"docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/A05-SHA256SUMS\"\n  ],\n  \"arm\": \"baseline\",\n  \"instruction\": \"Implement the task in this repository. Do not inspect or modify tests in the final hidden oracle. Do not install dependencies, use network, create loops/retries, or modify product locks. Report exact checks you actually ran.\"\n}\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command 'Get-ChildItem -Force | Select-Object Mode,Name'","aggregated_output":"\r\nMode  Name\r\n----  ----\r\nd---- .agents\r\nd---- .github\r\nd---- .rsi\r\nd---- artifacts\r\nd---- docs\r\nd---- electron\r\nd---- harness\r\nd---- openclaw_runtime\r\nd---- packages\r\nd---- patches\r\nd---- plans\r\nd---- public\r\nd---- reports\r\nd---- resources\r\nd---- scripts\r\nd---- shared\r\nd---- src\r\nd---- team\r\nd---- tests\r\n-a--- .env.example\r\n-a--- .gitattributes\r\n-a--- .gitignore\r\n-a--- .mcp.json\r\n-a--- .npmrc\r\n-a--- .prettierrc\r\n-a--- AGENTS.md\r\n-a--- clawx-extensions.json\r\n-a--- CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md\r\n-a--- components.json\r\n-a--- electron-builder.yml\r\n-a--- entitlements.mac.plist\r\n-a--- eslint.config.mjs\r\n-a--- index.html\r\n-a--- LICENSE\r\n-a--- package.json\r\n-a--- playwright.config.ts\r\n-a--- pnpm-lock.yaml\r\n-a--- pnpm-workspace.yaml\r\n-a--- postcss.config.js\r\n-a--- README.ja-JP.md\r\n-a--- README.md\r\n-a--- README.ru-RU.md\r\n-a--- README.zh-CN.md\r\n-a--- SECURITY.md\r\n-a--- skills-lock.json\r\n-a--- tailwind.config.js\r\n-a--- tsconfig.json\r\n-a--- tsconfig.node.json\r\n-a--- tsconfig.test.json\r\n-a--- tsconfig.web.json\r\n-a--- vite.config.ts\r\n-a--- vitest.agent-dev.node.config.ts\r\n-a--- vitest.config.ts\r\n-a--- vitest.runtime-effectiveness.config.ts\r\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
